  "content_text": "\r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n            Manhattan Active SCALE Documentation\r\n        Labor Web Services\r\n    \r\n    \r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        The following web services are all related to the Labor functional area of the application:\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n            Web Service\r\n\r\n            Description\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n            Labor Event\r\n\r\n            Allows consumers to POST labor events in the application.\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n            Labor Search\r\n\r\n            Allows consumers to GET labor events stored in the application.\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n            Labor Update\r\n\r\n            Allows consumers to update labor events through PUTs.\r\n        \r\n    \r\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n  ©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
  "search_text": "\r\n    \n\r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n            \nManhattan Active SCALE Documentation\n\r\n        \n\nLabor Web Services\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \n\r\n        \nThe following web services are all related to the Labor functional area of the application:\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nWeb Service\n\r\n\r\n            \nDescription\n\r\n        \n\r\n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nLabor Event\n\r\n\r\n            \nAllows consumers to POST labor events in the application.\n\r\n        \n\r\n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nLabor Search\n\r\n\r\n            \nAllows consumers to GET labor events stored in the application.\n\r\n        \n\r\n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nLabor Update\n\r\n\r\n            \nAllows consumers to update labor events through PUTs.\n\r\n        \n\r\n    \n\r\n\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
